Package: occenv
Type: Package
Title: Build Environmental Rasters from Dated Species Occurrences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jenicca", "Poongavanan", email = "jenicca1193@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Matches species occurrences to monthly environmental raster layers,
    aggregates occurrence cells, and fills background cells using a shared time
    period. Preserves native raster grids and returns combined stacks only when
    those grids match. Reports exclusions, temporal substitutions, and missing
    values without changing the input data.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: terra (>= 1.7-0)
URL: https://github.com/JeniccaP/occenv
BugReports: https://github.com/JeniccaP/occenv/issues
